Package: dnsr
Title: Dynamic Nelson-Siegel Term Structure Model
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Ariel", "R. H.", email = "ariel@ambientpointcorp.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implementation of the Dynamic Nelson-Siegel (DNS) model for yield curve 
    modeling. This package provides functions for downloading Treasury yield curve data, 
    calibrating DNS model parameters, estimating factor dynamics, and simulating 
    yield curves using advanced stochastic differential equation methods through the 
    YUIMA framework. It includes visualization tools and utilities for working with
    interest rate term structures in a financial context.
